        <body>
            <div xml:id="d483">

                <pb facs="0455" n="339" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg339"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.032/5.]</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 136.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-03-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 11, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose you herewith,
                    two copies of the message which President Victoria presented to Congress on the
                    occasion of his inauguration as Constitutional President of the Republic on
                    February 27th, with a translation of the portions thereof of direct interest to
                    the United States.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">William W. Russell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d483-a1.xml" xpointer="d483-a1"/>
            </div>
